wish away our love.

472
00:34:17,597 --> 00:34:19,056
[GRUNTS]

473
00:34:19,391 --> 00:34:20,975
Oh.

474
00:34:22,269 --> 00:34:23,644
Hah.

475
00:34:27,482 --> 00:34:29,442
Hey, kid.

476
00:34:31,319 --> 00:34:33,487
I didn't wanna have to do this.

477
00:34:35,323 --> 00:34:36,949
Oh!

478
00:34:40,245 --> 00:34:42,163
You wished a man dead?

479
00:34:42,372 --> 00:34:45,791
-l love you more than anything.
-Stop saying that. Stop it.

480
00:34:45,959 --> 00:34:48,794
But l do. More than anything.

481
00:34:49,755 --> 00:34:53,424
More than me. More than life.

482
00:34:53,592 --> 00:34:57,094
Oh, Wes. Don't hate me.

483
00:35:03,018 --> 00:35:06,896
It'll be okay. I'll make it okay.

484
00:35:08,356 --> 00:35:09,982
It'll be okay.

485
00:35:14,196 --> 00:35:16,322
[RUMBLING]

486
00:35:16,698 --> 00:35:18,532
[GRUNTlNG]

487
00:35:29,294 --> 00:35:31,212
[GASPS THEN COUGHS]

488
00:35:40,806 --> 00:35:44,975
[BOTH BREATHlNG HEAVILY]

489
00:35:45,143 --> 00:35:49,647
Okay. Follow my lead
and you won't have a problem.

490
00:35:49,815 --> 00:35:51,398
Come on.

491
00:35:52,943 --> 00:35:56,445
Okay, man, no more. No more, okay?

492
00:35:57,572 --> 00:36:00,866
I wouldn't mess with this kid any more
if l were you.

493
00:36:04,454 --> 00:36:06,497
Stay back.

494
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:20,177
Hope?

495
00:36:22,889 --> 00:36:24,223
Do I know you?

496
00:36:38,196 --> 00:36:50,583
[BELL JlNGLES]

497
00:37:44,679 --> 00:37:50,434
Well, the coin's melted down.
It shouldn't cause any more problems.

498
00:37:50,602 --> 00:37:54,688
Audrey's parents are back from Bali.
Looks like all the wishes are gone.

499
00:37:54,856 --> 00:37:57,107
And so are we.

500
00:38:00,028 --> 00:38:01,195
[EXHALES]

501
00:38:01,363 --> 00:38:04,198
-Hang on a second.
-What?

502
00:38:07,327 --> 00:38:08,827
You were right.

503
00:38:11,206 --> 00:38:13,123
About what?

504
00:38:13,458 --> 00:38:15,292
I shouldn't have lied to you.

505
00:38:17,545 --> 00:38:21,131
I do remember everything
that happened to me in the pit.

506
00:38:22,676 --> 00:38:24,635
Everything.

507
00:38:29,474 --> 00:38:31,308
So tell me about it.

508
00:38:32,310 --> 00:38:33,811
No.

509
00:38:35,730 --> 00:38:40,401
I won't lie anymore.
But l'm not gonna talk about it.

510
00:38:43,238 --> 00:38:47,324
Dean, look, you can't just shoulder
this thing alone. You gotta let me help.

511
00:38:47,701 --> 00:38:48,826
How?

512
00:38:49,536 --> 00:38:51,245
You think a little heart-to-heart...

513
00:38:51,413 --> 00:38:54,999
...and some sharing and caring
is gonna change anything? Huh?

514
00:38:55,166 --> 00:38:57,584
And somehow heal me?

515
00:38:59,379 --> 00:39:02,423
I'm not talking about a bad day here.

516
00:39:02,632 --> 00:39:03,757
I know that.

517
00:39:03,925 --> 00:39:06,260
The things that l saw....

518
00:39:08,179 --> 00:39:10,431
There aren't words.

519
00:39:12,225 --> 00:39:17,438
There is no forgetting.
There's no making it better.

520
00:39:19,774 --> 00:39:24,945
Because it is right here, forever.

521
00:39:29,367 --> 00:39:31,535
You wouldn't understand.

522
00:39:32,537 --> 00:39:35,706
And l could never
make you understand.

523
00:39:36,541 --> 00:39:38,876
So l am sorry.

524
00:40:30,512 --> 00:40:32,513
[ENGLISH SDH]

